1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,869
Rereading creates familiarity, but familiarity is not recall.

2
00:00:03,869 --> 00:00:07,565
Loci Loom turns anything you study into a world you can walk through.

3
00:00:07,565 --> 00:00:11,880
Enter a subject, and the working app creates five vivid landmarks.

4
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:15,228
Each stop binds one idea to a place, image, and story.

5
00:00:15,228 --> 00:00:19,913
Then three spatial prompts test the concept, its location, and the order of the route.

6
00:00:19,913 --> 00:00:26,217
The resulting recall score changes the next review interval, so weak paths return sooner and strong ones wait longer.

7
00:00:26,217 --> 00:00:28,141
Three created trails are free.

8
00:00:28,141 --> 00:00:35,380
Scholar Pass unlocks unlimited trails, deeper adaptive practice, source-grounded generation, and a growing memory library.

9
00:00:35,380 --> 00:00:41,630
RevenueCat powers offerings, entitlement checks, purchases, and restoration behind a tested billing boundary.

10
00:00:41,630 --> 00:00:48,423
Loci Loom makes a proven memory technique immediate: a world for every idea, and a path back to every memory.

